<title>USA: Bally Total Fitness completes securitization.</title>
<headline>Bally Total Fitness completes securitization.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bally Total Fitness on Tuesday said it completed a new $160 million accounts-receivable securitization facility, replacing a $150 million securitization facility.</p>
<p>The new facility extends the revolving period for 30 months at improved rates averaging less than 8.5 percent, the company said.</p>
<p>Bally Total Fitness is an operator of fitness centers in the United States.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
